WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.150
Ryu blocks Drive Impact beside the wall.

2
00:00:01.150 --> 00:00:02.100
Crouching heavy kick catches the wall-splatted Ryu.

3
00:00:02.100 --> 00:00:02.600
The target follow-up continues the juggle.

4
00:00:02.600 --> 00:00:03.950
Heavy Somersault Kick lifts Ryu beside the wall.

5
00:00:03.950 --> 00:00:05.050
Guile lands and juggles with Overdrive Somersault Kick.

6
00:00:05.050 --> 00:00:05.250
Ryu lands after the two-Flash-Kick wall route.
